          "debt_progress": {
            "id": "debt_progress",
            "text": "Four. They come at a light, so don't carry one, and don't be the brightest thing on the sand.",
            "choices": [
              {
                "label": "Noted.",
                "nextNodeId": "farewell",
                "conditions": []
              }
            ],
            "actions": []
          },
          "debt_settle": {
            "id": "debt_settle",
            "text": "Rendered. Four hundred and ten in oil, near enough.\n[He turns the ledger round so you can read it.] Here's Maro's balance. Here's the line where I write who paid it. That line can have your name on it, and the girl breathes free tomorrow morning. Or it stays open — debts don't spoil down here, nothing does — and I put four hundred in your hand instead.\nI'm not going to argue with you either way. I've watched people choose both and I've stopped being surprised.",
            "choices": [
              {
                "label": "Clear the girl's debt.",
                "nextNodeId": "debt_cleared",
                "conditions": []
              },
              {
                "label": "I'll take the oil-price.",
                "nextNodeId": "debt_kept",
                "conditions": []
              }
            ],
            "actions": []
          },
          "debt_cleared": {
            "id": "debt_cleared",
            "text": "[He writes it. It takes four seconds and eleven years.]\nRight. That's the ledger shut on Ceyl Maro, which is more than his god managed for him.\nHundred for your trouble — it's what I can spare and still eat. Her name's Sesh. She's nine. She won't thank you. I will.",
            "choices": [],
            "actions": [
              {
                "type": "GIVE_GOLD",
                "target": "",
                "value": "",
                "amount": 100
              },
