                "amount": 0
              }
            ]
          },
          "debt_kept": {
            "id": "debt_kept",
            "text": "[He counts it out without comment and writes nothing in the book.]\nFour hundred. Ledger stays open. She'll clear it by forty if she keeps out of the deep water.\nDon't look at me like that. I gave you the choice, which is more than the dome ever gave me.",
            "choices": [],
